{"id":"en_secret-to-mrs-lowe","title":"Secret to Mrs. Lowe","titleEn":"Secret to Mrs. Lowe","description":"Celia Shaw arrives at Ethan Lowe’s manor posing as a servant, concealing who she really is in order to spare her father from execution. The manor’s harsh commander has no tolerance for women under his roof, but a single reckless night alters the situation between them. Months afterward, Celia is pregnant and pursued by a jealous rival who is trying to kill her. The question becomes whether Ethan will learn her true identity in time to prevent disaster.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/secret-to-mrs-lowe/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/secret-to-mrs-lowe/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Secret Identity","One Night Stand","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmq60/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_secret-to-mrs-lowe_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmq60/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-to-mrs-lowe_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmq60/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-to-mrs-lowe_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmq60/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-to-mrs-lowe_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmq60/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-to-mrs-lowe_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"numb